  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Fabric版铁箱子</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric版铁箱子是一款简单的模组，通过添加新的、可升级的箱子来增强您的Minecraft游戏体验，让您可以在单个方块中存储更多物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">每个箱子都可以升级，从木箱（原版Minecraft）开始。只需制作一个箱子升级组件，然后按住SHIFT键并右键点击您想要升级的箱子即可。这样就不需要破坏已放置的箱子了。不用担心，箱子内的物品将保留不变。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0FJGgga.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"559\"></span></p>\n<h3>新增水晶箱子</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/675/2021-07-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"605\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欢迎通过GitHub上的“Issue”部分提出任何改进建议以贡献于模组开发，或使用“Pull Request”部分进行代码改进。您也可以使用后者提交模组的翻译（或现有翻译的更新）。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模组要求</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://images2.imgbox.com/8e/38/bfInI5qv_o.png\" width=\"149\" height=\"50\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>箱子升级：<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圣诞：27格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铜：45格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">铁：54格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">金：81格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">绿宝石：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">钻石：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">水晶：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑曜石：108格</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>箱子</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>铜箱子</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/677/310/172/copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"139\"><br>铁箱子<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/678/310/172/iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>金箱子<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/679/310/172/gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"><br>钻石箱子<br><br>黑曜石箱子<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/680/310/172/obisidina.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>升级物品</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>木箱升级为铜箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/683/310/172/wood-copper.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"138\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br>铜箱升级为铁箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/685/310/172/copper-iron.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br>铁箱升级为金箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/686/310/172/iron-gold.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"136\"><br>金箱升级为钻石箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/687/310/172/gold-diamond.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"140\"><br>钻石箱升级为黑曜石箱<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/375/688/310/172/diamond-obsidian.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"137\"><br></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>已知问题</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前暂无已知问题。如果您发现任何问题，请在GitHub上报告，说明您如何遇到该问题、如何复现它，并附上崩溃日志和其他类型的证据。</span></p>",
